n- **II.** Its range is $y\\in [-2,2]$\n- **III.** $y=-\\frac{3}{2}$ is an output of the function" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. At $x=\\frac{3\\pi }{2}$, the function $y=cos⁡x$ takes the value zero.\n\n- Statements II and III are false. The range of the function $y=cos⁡x$ is $y\\in [-1,1].$ Thus, $y=-\\frac{3}{2}$ is not an output of this function."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237983 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "54f7039a-2f3c-5e11-b655-d32aed6af515" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437306} {:answer/id #uuid "d0e0e83d-6b7c-5018-bd20-49f606eedb04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437307}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "54f7039a-2f3c-5e11-b655-d32aed6af515" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437306} :answer-field/id #uuid "e78118cd-b206-5d3b-aac4-77a392c6c22c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438682} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6fbfbd2d-9a45-5a4b-b854-d3e63ee7830d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437308} {:answer/id #uuid "0c07a39f-6574-5ab6-9301-59c89b690d89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0c07a39f-6574-5ab6-9301-59c89b690d89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437309} :answer-field/id #uuid "62b3d79d-1762-5848-9642-6db59cbc38e2" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438683} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "efed1b10-8121-5609-a029-df7005434c78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437310} {:answer/id #uuid "82200c6e-534d-5c90-9855-36c2db1fd8ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437311}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "efed1b10-8121-5609-a029-df7005434c78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437310} :answer-field/id #uuid "24c76314-0f5c-552b-9634-7a579528542d" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438684}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4afb86c8-970f-594e-bb88-36f6e2c3e725" :question/math-academy-id "q-103233" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=cos⁡x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The zeros of the function are $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi $\n- **II.** Its graph passes through the point $(0,1)$\n- **III.** The function has maximum values at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false. The zeros occur at $x=\\pm \\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pm \\frac{3\\pi }{2},…,$ which can be written as $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is true. At $x=0,$ the function has the value $y=cos⁡0=1.$ Therefore, the graph of the function passes through the point $(0,1).$\n\n- Statement III is false. The function has a maximum at $x=0,\\pm 2\\pi ,…,$ which can be written as $x=2n\\pi .$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292696 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5868b07-bcc9-5439-8718-abc34721e4f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438022} {:answer/id #uuid "b4492437-18b0-5ea5-afe3-0c95f6e8c559" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438023}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b4492437-18b0-5ea5-afe3-0c95f6e8c559" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438023} :answer-field/id #uuid "049db57c-a0e7-56de-b01d-934b8edb71e7" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439040} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f4c2d785-bfd8-52bd-920b-fdf30600fb45" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438024} {:answer/id #uuid "65d473ca-16c2-5906-9a4b-4d38e4d203a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438025}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4c2d785-bfd8-52bd-920b-fdf30600fb45" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438024} :answer-field/id #uuid "e8b8f0da-7701-59ac-b62e-e3c7f0b5a210" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439041} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "88d518a6-aec2-5916-b3c0-47b033deb6e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438026} {:answer/id #uuid "0e2171a1-1911-5a58-a449-b31bc5f2edce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "88d518a6-aec2-5916-b3c0-47b033deb6e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438026} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf911183-758e-5ef8-9432-74581ddfaa58" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439042}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "69137884-05b3-53be-9c7c-95b53b1ed329" :question/math-academy-id "q-27009" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function intersects the $x$-axis at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$\n\n- **II.** The function has a minimum value at  $x=2\\pi .$\n\n- **III.** The function intersects the $y$-axis at $y=0.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/9c/9c77bec4ebb04668fbff5176418ed9c09143a8660879fdf523a158c5f109006c.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. At $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ the function intersects the $x$-axis.\n\n- Statement II is false. The function has a maximum at $x=2\\pi .$\n\n- Statement III is false. The function intersects the $y$-axis at $y=1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338799 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b7fc3c01-7f3a-5c6b-abd7-c743ce206e9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438490} {:answer/id #uuid "47099553-c6c1-5bd1-9e0e-9f21c98fc65f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438491}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7fc3c01-7f3a-5c6b-abd7-c743ce206e9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438490} :answer-field/id #uuid "a81ed0d9-7e42-5cbb-aca1-b03bc48b3022" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439274} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46870e8a-9f05-53d2-a4ea-6c68291e1467" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438492} {:answer/id #uuid "71ec84ae-38af-5df8-81fd-d23b40330600" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438493}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71ec84ae-38af-5df8-81fd-d23b40330600" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438493} :answer-field/id #uuid "faf0da50-2691-505e-8eef-7d1db6e3c6e2" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439275} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "550bb9f1-5049-57d7-84d3-41f3f2ac8184" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438494} {:answer/id #uuid "a91fa62b-3e27-5516-b774-e6cf906a51d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438495}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "550bb9f1-5049-57d7-84d3-41f3f2ac8184" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438494} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5214bf9-b022-5d37-a8e8-c3abbfca85a8" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439276}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f5773d37-2017-53ae-a0d1-64c772d0dcaf" :question/math-academy-id "q-70666" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=cos⁡x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function has maximum values at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi .$\n- **II.** The function is zero at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$\n- **III.** The range of the function is $[-\\pi ,\\pi ].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false. The function has a maximum at $x=0,\\pm 2\\pi ,…,$ which can be written as $x=2n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is true. At $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$, the function intersects the $x$-axis.\n\n- Statement III is false. The minimum value is $-1$, the maximum value is $1$, and so the range is $[-1,1].$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338800 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "991d9c5f-a832-550c-b508-1bc99acc792d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438496} {:answer/id #uuid "699ada80-0b45-5f12-a290-7e8d352f34e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438497}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "699ada80-0b45-5f12-a290-7e8d352f34e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438497} :answer-field/id #uuid "70665897-25d9-5fb8-b277-0ed7bc737d42" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439277} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "66266660-a17d-5cab-9611-596953bfded0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438498} {:answer/id #uuid "529ad213-185b-543a-be0e-63b5e783c340" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438499}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "529ad213-185b-543a-be0e-63b5e783c340" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438499} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c9a569f-7beb-55df-b6ed-b7c76b589ecb" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439278} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9326e664-12a0-57da-b2ff-7159b17d534b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438500} {:answer/id #uuid "8cfbb402-00a5-5543-8bc2-4d82370d544c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438501}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9326e664-12a0-57da-b2ff-7159b17d534b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438500} :answer-field/id #uuid "39ce8d5b-318c-5474-9063-3a51adf37c70" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439279}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "24b90149-221d-555e-91aa-b1d1cb7cb1c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-70667" :question/problem "Which of the following statements regarding the graph of $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The graph intersects the $y$-axis at $y=1$\n\n- **II.** The function has a minimum value at $x=-\\pi .$\n\n- **III.** The range of the function is $[-\\pi ,\\pi ].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. The $y$-intercepts of the function is $y=1.$\n\n- Statement II is true. The function at $x=-\\pi $ has a minimum value.\n\n- Statement III is false. The minimum value is $-1$, the maximum value is $1$, and so the range is $[-1,1].$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511988 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61e3a7d8-7256-58da-815e-b8f0dda9e6b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512020} {:answer/id #uuid "84529515-48e3-520e-bfd1-3868a9402a05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512040}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "84529515-48e3-520e-bfd1-3868a9402a05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512040} :answer-field/id #uuid "4355f151-f54d-57b7-8dcd-e52174dbc60e" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512010} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31b822ea-d79a-561e-bbe1-96f2aa290bba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511999} {:answer/id #uuid "560b4ac7-4028-5d7f-9dee-814213d524b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512018}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "560b4ac7-4028-5d7f-9dee-814213d524b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512018} :answer-field/id #uuid "7553d696-d4bd-5fce-8cb1-3075bcb22340" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512031} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cce4ff9-d81f-585b-8527-5b41abd3d68c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512036} {:answer/id #uuid "a029a29f-51c9-5fa2-a876-4daa2792a47d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512053}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a029a29f-51c9-5fa2-a876-4daa2792a47d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512053} :answer-field/id #uuid "f7cbd98c-0e18-5f50-a46a-5148cb29c545" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512079}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "1482e5f8-11d5-5027-aa8c-bab1e79796ae" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\cos x$? Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The complete set of inputs at which the function has zeros is $x=n\\pi.$\n- **II.** The complete set of inputs at which the function has maximum values is $x=n\\pi.$\n- **III.** The complete set of inputs at which the function has minimum values is $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\cos x$.\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false. The zeros occur at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi$. Every zero must be included.\n\n- Statement II is false. The maximum value is $1$, attained at $x=2n\\pi$. Every maximum input must be included.\n\n- Statement III is false. The minimum value is $-1$, attained at $x=\\pi+2n\\pi$. Every minimum input must be included."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511995 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "741fac4f-1236-55d2-8c70-cfc0af005c93" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512030} {:answer/id #uuid "d6570710-b647-565c-a2c9-8585a674a4fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512068}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6570710-b647-565c-a2c9-8585a674a4fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512068} :answer-field/id #uuid "068801a3-9623-53de-aa7f-3acc77125b93" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511983} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "056e2ce5-e610-549c-a163-cf4528eb99be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511982} {:answer/id #uuid "cd8ee2f5-a72f-56ba-ac9b-dc17f121fef6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512066}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "056e2ce5-e610-549c-a163-cf4528eb99be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511982} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6c654b4-1a53-5dbc-9411-9cca0b1b1aff" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512070} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "92681729-47a6-5427-aec1-03c9d4dd5df6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512046} {:answer/id #uuid "f1e78bbc-95d5-5df6-9a9c-07ba7b8b80ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512075}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f1e78bbc-95d5-5df6-9a9c-07ba7b8b80ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512075} :answer-field/id #uuid "f6909370-19f2-5a16-b8ab-80f2876d0ed6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512078}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "28204067-d44a-5402-8c5b-2fe033d1ea9d" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\cos x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The graph intersects the $y$-axis at $y=1.$\n- **II.** The function has a maximum value at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}.$\n- **III.** The function has a maximum value at $x=\\pi.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\cos x$.\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. At $x=0$, the function has value $\\cos 0=1$.\n\n- Statement II is false. $\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2})=0$.\n\n- Statement III is false. $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511996 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9fff82ab-ccc2-54e8-a477-b1f06cfd3664" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512052} {:answer/id #uuid "fea87ffa-961d-547f-9753-66b8606137ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512080}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9fff82ab-ccc2-54e8-a477-b1f06cfd3664" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512052} :answer-field/id #uuid "09c35091-41c9-543d-a496-31bb6379010a" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5adf5b71-28b3-57c2-b043-03826303a6ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512019} {:answer/id #uuid "cca60a72-5960-52a7-a417-f533ae247149