6ff1fa21c11" :question/problem "If $\\cos x=\\frac{1}{7},$ then $2\\cos (x-14\\pi )+2=$" :question/worked-solution "The period of $y=\\cos x$ is $2\\pi .$ Therefore, for an integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\n\\cos x=\\cos (x+2n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=-7$ into the right-hand-side of the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\cos x=\\cos (x+2\\cdot (-7)\\cdot \\pi )=\\cos (x-14\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $\\cos x=\\frac{1}{7},$ then $\\cos (x-14\\pi )=\\frac{1}{7}.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\cos (x-14\\pi )+2 & =2(\\frac{1}{7})+2 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{7}+2 \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511924 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f260668-83d5-5737-be7a-fcd41740577c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{19}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511934} {:answer/id #uuid "7534c7ed-b9b9-5a4e-b7cc-648e83cbe230" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{34}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511943} {:answer/id #uuid "7b4eb6cc-0bc2-52a2-b07f-504b6d6ecb53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511945} {:answer/id #uuid "c55cc9ed-9a42-5e6f-9fff-988edf9b714f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{34}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511967} {:answer/id #uuid "e8d21f26-67b9-5b1e-b9e7-725f74bfd9d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{76}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511976}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7b4eb6cc-0bc2-52a2-b07f-504b6d6ecb53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511945} :answer-field/id #uuid "e5a37119-64a0-594b-a7bb-6f870c3ecc3e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511975}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "24687af9-7fd4-5bfe-b0b9-67927f0